cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its released results, please cite the paper and the DeePore dataset."
title: "conformal-digital-rock: conformal uncertainty and risk-controlled simulation triage for digital rock"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/gulzara3/conformal-digital-rock"
abstract: >
  Code, data pipeline, trained-model outputs, tables and figures for a study of conformal prediction
  for deep-learning prediction of six pore-network properties of 14,174 DeePore micro-CT volumes:
  property-wise and joint coverage, an exact finite-sample test of the implementation, a label-free
  out-of-distribution guard, weighted conformal prediction and Learn-then-Test simulation triage.
